// What happens between two countries short of a war (Escalation.cs). Each review, a pair in
// friction or worse may have an incident, likelier the higher its tension and likelier between
// neighbours. One is drawn from those that fit, by weight.
//
//   name, description   what the news calls it and what it is (localisation keys are the English)
//   stage, max_stage    the lowest and highest stage it happens at: 1 friction, 2 crisis, 3 clashes
//   weight              how often, against the others that fit
//   tension             what it does to the tension (negative calms it)
//   grievance           what it adds to the victim's grievance
//   losses              men lost on each side
//   war_support         what it does to the victim's war support - the rally
//   opinion             the opinion reason it leaves (common/opinion_modifiers)
//   border / naval      needs a land border; needs both to have a navy
//
// A mod adds an incident with a new key, changes one by naming it, removes one with "remove": true.
{
